      "title": "gitlab-ci: retrieve the number of commits in the MR and run checks.",
      "message": "gitlab-ci: retrieve the number of commits in the MR and run checks.\n\nInstead of assuming the CI runs on the very last commit, retrieve the\nnumber of commits involved in this MR and run all the checks using that\nas parameter.\n\nRef: #17114.\n",
